2.8,2013,55,88,22],[27325,77.4,2013,52,86,25],[27326,52.2,2013,50,82,26]],"links":[["Curry County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/oregon/curry-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, July to August came in under 90% of normal in 45 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle of Curry County&rsquo;s 16 grids. In 2025 the middle ran 15% of normal in June to July and 21% in July to August. So far in 2026, May to June sits at 35% of normal on the middle. Grid 26425 had its driest year in 2013 at 41% of normal.</p>"}
